# The define sets of default/main.vert with a Slang twin (task 0072, stage f): what the GLSL compiles with (the Mode
# defines the stage imports), and for a set with TEXCOORD or PARTICLE the pipeline's count of texture coordinate sets
# (UVSETS_<n>, vsgUtil::uvSetsDefine). The content decides most names, so the sets are open-ended; these are the ones
# the default settings and the common profiles create, confirmed with OPENEDEN_SHADER_TRACE. Any other set draws with
# the GLSL. Lines are canonical (sorted, "-" for none).
# Default settings (traced in Balmora, Seyda Neen by day and at night, and the Caldera Guild of Mages):
COLOR MORPH NORMAL TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
COLOR NORMAL SKIN TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
COLOR NORMAL TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
COLOR NORMAL VERTEX
MORPH NORMAL TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
NORMAL SKIN TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
NORMAL SKIN VERTEX
NORMAL TEXCOORD UVSETS_1 VERTEX
NORMAL VERTEX
PARTICLE UVSETS_1
